{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/44e020a7c18d2451ffddcdc893494ead.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/44e020a7c18d2451ffddcdc893494ead.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/44e020a7c18d2451ffddcdc893494ead.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/b820f8828dc1f19a1d2ea5489bc15477.webp?t=1770818018\" width=615 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/140a08376219ce4cb105bdf7c6c90c19.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/140a08376219ce4cb105bdf7c6c90c19.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/140a08376219ce4cb105bdf7c6c90c19.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Dragonkin: The Banished, a world corrupted by the blood of dragons, where evil creatures rise from the entrails of the earth. Choose one of the legendary hero classes, each with a single mission: hunt down and destroy the draconic creatures. Each battle brings you closer to your ultimate goal: finding and eliminating the terrifying Dragon Lords. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/0bd34d981da95d520d0a0c138d576acc.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/0bd34d981da95d520d0a0c138d576acc.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/0bd34d981da95d520d0a0c138d576acc.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/515edac44a981d7f111ec1f637bd40dd.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/515edac44a981d7f111ec1f637bd40dd.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/515edac44a981d7f111ec1f637bd40dd.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has their own abilities and combat techniques to challenge the dragons. Your character, equipment, wyrmling and the Ancestral Grid evolve as you progress. <br><br>The Tracker: As the best hunter in her clan, she takes her role very seriously, and her techniques strike fear into the hearts of her enemies: she uses her prey to develop her skills and improve her arsenal. Monsters that escape her arrows, blades, or traps will perish from the poisons she concocts.<br>\t <br>The Barbarian: Following a dangerous traditional ritual, he became a dragon-blood: half-man, half-monster. His supernatural strength and ice powers combined with legendary rage allow him to defeat the toughest enemies.<br> <br>The Oracle: Metamorphosed by the blood of the blue dragon without losing her humanity, she aspires to a world where dragons and humans live in harmony. She uses her electric draconic powers with precision, and can amplify them using her visions.\t <br><br>The Knight: Trained in combat from a young age, he masters the fire lance with unparalleled skill. His unwavering faith in the Eternal and his unwavering determination make him impervious to any draconic corruption. He presents himself as the light that will banish darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/1bf6ab2f009b5a6e51abf95792434701.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/1bf6ab2f009b5a6e51abf95792434701.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/1bf6ab2f009b5a6e51abf95792434701.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/d743cf0656cf64bfd4312c79969020af.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/d743cf0656cf64bfd4312c79969020af.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/d743cf0656cf64bfd4312c79969020af.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Ancestral Grid of skills, an innovative mechanic used to transform your character into a legendary fighter with unique powers. Acquire skills as combat loot, and strategically place them in the grid next to a wide range of modifiers. Optimize each position to define your fighting style and become more powerful. Each hero has their own grid and  various combinations of abilities and modifiers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/fc3f943b6d118af996a92db1a7ba019b.webp?t=1770818018\" width=615 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/c34e2eadf07af913a0f52016c0a08f1b.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/c34e2eadf07af913a0f52016c0a08f1b.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/c34e2eadf07af913a0f52016c0a08f1b.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight draconic monsters and reveal their story by travelling across the world of Dragonkin.<br>Jungles, ancient islands, toxic swamps, plains, glaciers, arid volcanoes, and many other places are waiting to be explored. As you hunt you will discover everything the world has to offer. Each region has its own culture, from ancient civilizations to the  people of the north. Original monsters also lurk within, each possessing abilities and elements (Ice, Poison, Fire, Electricity) that set them apart, as well as resources you can use to upgrade your hero.<br>The world of Dragonkin is constantly changing, and each mission is a new game experience. Re-explore areas you have visited to see them in a whole new light. You may encounter rain, fog and storms, depending on your mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/2974a0d0f62ba72817eb1a63feb9a34b.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/2974a0d0f62ba72817eb1a63feb9a34b.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/2974a0d0f62ba72817eb1a63feb9a34b.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/496d9607eea5c5046b1dcc8e6c24e924.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/496d9607eea5c5046b1dcc8e6c24e924.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/496d9607eea5c5046b1dcc8e6c24e924.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled in the heart of the mountains, safe from the dragons and their roars, lies a huge city, humanity's last bastion. The city grows and changes based on your decisions and discoveries. As you progress, decide which area of its development to focus on. Upgrade your buildings, welcome new inhabitants and find equipment and additional services to transform this refuge into a genuine haven for humanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/10f63a0e10a3363aec8249a312b5aaeb.webp?t=1770818018\" width=615 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/2bd6113e54f96492d96c1926d562ec4d.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/2bd6113e54f96492d96c1926d562ec4d.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/2bd6113e54f96492d96c1926d562ec4d.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, Dragonkin: The Banished will receive regular updates adding additional content and new gameplay features. In particular, online multiplayer will be available soon.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/177b55fc75abd028ba0217bc04d88e93.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/177b55fc75abd028ba0217bc04d88e93.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/177b55fc75abd028ba0217bc04d88e93.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"TROPHY_01_NAME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1863430/48b9345c1a0810c7e89eebe26daf85d1b407f4ee.jpg"},{"name":"TROPHY_02_NAME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1863430/2dd63d0295e6e545a000cdb4b672dabe5fb6b3c8.jpg"},{"name":"TROPHY_03_NAME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1863430/8a6b33c5f508a9ac2426f04dd00ed6763a8856e5.jpg"},{"name":"TROPHY_04_NAME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1863430/1bd8bc039461e9e4bccf9534f2cf84966d71fa01.jpg"},{"name":"TROPHY_05_NAME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1863430/2057fc1a8f7a23da96c7cd786a937d24680be150.jpg"},{"name":"TROPHY_06_NAME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1863430/054c621f114bde539bd1ff56ffd3b5e0fa7b45c4.jpg"},{"name":"TROPHY_07_NAME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1863430/8d68885b6349c1a292e8d25bb79b01b7efe4aeef.jpg"},{"name":"TROPHY_08_NAME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1863430/133c55c58e4d834fdc0bc920937a001466c79a80.jpg"},{"name":"TROPHY_09_NAME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1863430/4f5ecd8d1d9e8f275c9a385cea42f0877e54bc97.jpg"},{"name":"TROPHY_10_NAME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1863430/852c5854d14f75177a8f7eeb75d11d51e95f5af1.jpg"}],"total":44},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1863430?t=1770818018","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/b831c776025f555943259cef0f58348ee367d1b0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770818018","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/7d57d994ba0eb742f314e22a98193247023de8d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770818018","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/7d57d994ba0eb742f314e22a98193247023de8d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770818018","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features violence and blood."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/6887793b1fd18a83c06beeed3ae09909.avif?t=1770818018\" width=780 height=615 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/44e020a7c18d2451ffddcdc893494ead.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/44e020a7c18d2451ffddcdc893494ead.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/44e020a7c18d2451ffddcdc893494ead.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/b820f8828dc1f19a1d2ea5489bc15477.webp?t=1770818018\" width=615 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/140a08376219ce4cb105bdf7c6c90c19.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/140a08376219ce4cb105bdf7c6c90c19.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/140a08376219ce4cb105bdf7c6c90c19.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Dragonkin: The Banished, a world corrupted by the blood of dragons, where evil creatures rise from the entrails of the earth. Choose one of the legendary hero classes, each with a single mission: hunt down and destroy the draconic creatures. Each battle brings you closer to your ultimate goal: finding and eliminating the terrifying Dragon Lords. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/0bd34d981da95d520d0a0c138d576acc.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/0bd34d981da95d520d0a0c138d576acc.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/0bd34d981da95d520d0a0c138d576acc.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/515edac44a981d7f111ec1f637bd40dd.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/515edac44a981d7f111ec1f637bd40dd.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/515edac44a981d7f111ec1f637bd40dd.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has their own abilities and combat techniques to challenge the dragons. Your character, equipment, wyrmling and the Ancestral Grid evolve as you progress. <br><br>The Tracker: As the best hunter in her clan, she takes her role very seriously, and her techniques strike fear into the hearts of her enemies: she uses her prey to develop her skills and improve her arsenal. Monsters that escape her arrows, blades, or traps will perish from the poisons she concocts.<br>\t <br>The Barbarian: Following a dangerous traditional ritual, he became a dragon-blood: half-man, half-monster. His supernatural strength and ice powers combined with legendary rage allow him to defeat the toughest enemies.<br> <br>The Oracle: Metamorphosed by the blood of the blue dragon without losing her humanity, she aspires to a world where dragons and humans live in harmony. She uses her electric draconic powers with precision, and can amplify them using her visions.\t <br><br>The Knight: Trained in combat from a young age, he masters the fire lance with unparalleled skill. His unwavering faith in the Eternal and his unwavering determination make him impervious to any draconic corruption. He presents himself as the light that will banish darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/1bf6ab2f009b5a6e51abf95792434701.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/1bf6ab2f009b5a6e51abf95792434701.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/1bf6ab2f009b5a6e51abf95792434701.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/d743cf0656cf64bfd4312c79969020af.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/d743cf0656cf64bfd4312c79969020af.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/d743cf0656cf64bfd4312c79969020af.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Ancestral Grid of skills, an innovative mechanic used to transform your character into a legendary fighter with unique powers. Acquire skills as combat loot, and strategically place them in the grid next to a wide range of modifiers. Optimize each position to define your fighting style and become more powerful. Each hero has their own grid and  various combinations of abilities and modifiers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/fc3f943b6d118af996a92db1a7ba019b.webp?t=1770818018\" width=615 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/c34e2eadf07af913a0f52016c0a08f1b.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/c34e2eadf07af913a0f52016c0a08f1b.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/c34e2eadf07af913a0f52016c0a08f1b.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight draconic monsters and reveal their story by travelling across the world of Dragonkin.<br>Jungles, ancient islands, toxic swamps, plains, glaciers, arid volcanoes, and many other places are waiting to be explored. As you hunt you will discover everything the world has to offer. Each region has its own culture, from ancient civilizations to the  people of the north. Original monsters also lurk within, each possessing abilities and elements (Ice, Poison, Fire, Electricity) that set them apart, as well as resources you can use to upgrade your hero.<br>The world of Dragonkin is constantly changing, and each mission is a new game experience. Re-explore areas you have visited to see them in a whole new light. You may encounter rain, fog and storms, depending on your mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/2974a0d0f62ba72817eb1a63feb9a34b.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/2974a0d0f62ba72817eb1a63feb9a34b.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/2974a0d0f62ba72817eb1a63feb9a34b.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/496d9607eea5c5046b1dcc8e6c24e924.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/496d9607eea5c5046b1dcc8e6c24e924.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/496d9607eea5c5046b1dcc8e6c24e924.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled in the heart of the mountains, safe from the dragons and their roars, lies a huge city, humanity's last bastion. The city grows and changes based on your decisions and discoveries. As you progress, decide which area of its development to focus on. Upgrade your buildings, welcome new inhabitants and find equipment and additional services to transform this refuge into a genuine haven for humanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/10f63a0e10a3363aec8249a312b5aaeb.webp?t=1770818018\" width=615 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/2bd6113e54f96492d96c1926d562ec4d.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/2bd6113e54f96492d96c1926d562ec4d.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/2bd6113e54f96492d96c1926d562ec4d.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, Dragonkin: The Banished will receive regular updates adding additional content and new gameplay features. In particular, online multiplayer will be available soon.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/177b55fc75abd028ba0217bc04d88e93.poster.avif?t=1770818018\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/177b55fc75abd028ba0217bc04d88e93.webm?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/extras/177b55fc75abd028ba0217bc04d88e93.mp4?t=1770818018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Eko Software"],"dlc":[3594850],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863430/25b03c1f61265b2c057ce17d952919a5b61b15a1/header.jpg?t=1770818018","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Nacon. \u00a92025 Published by Nacon and developed by EKO Software. All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1863430/426500476/5a558e2305119fd5f5372a38eb8ce883a107ade7/1770817063/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770818017","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1863430/426500476/5a558e2305119fd5f5372a38eb8ce883a107ade7/1770817063/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770818017","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1863430/426500476/5a558e2305119fd5f5372a38eb8ce883a107ade7/1770817063/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770818017","id":257282774,"name":"Release trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta